# ── Vercel Deployment Exclusion Manifest (.vercelignore) ────────────────────────
# Prevents large research datasets, caches, python scripts, and docs from
# failing Vercel build/deploy size limits on preview/dev branch deployments.
# IMPORTANT: Always prefix with '/' to match root only and never exclude src/app/api!

/scratch/
/learning/
/package/
/run_logs/
/temp_docx/
/indicators/
/graphify-out/
/.cache/
/.agents/
/.antigravitycli/
/.venv/
/__pycache__/
/docs/
/directives/

# Compressed archives & temporary binary packages
*.rar
*.zip

# Pine script & legacy text analysis dumps
*.txt
*.pine

# IDE & Tool configurations
.cursorrules
.graphifyignore
skills-lock.json
